From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:48:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix(web): fade a long project folder name under its
 new-thread action

In the boring sidebar the new-thread action is absolutely positioned left of
the chevron and shows on hover, on focus and always on touch. A long project
name ran under it, so the pencil icon was drawn over the truncated text.
Fade the name's end whenever the action shows, the same mask the thread rows
use, so the name ends before the action.
---
