 .../sidebar/SidebarProjectFolderHeader.tsx    |   8 +-
 2 files changed, 117 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarProjectFolderHeader.browser.test.tsx

